{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/grammar-checker/layout,_N_T_/tools/grammar-checker/page,_N_T_/tools/grammar-checker"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"id\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/c70a6d8e0709b465.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/7eb325243a3b1d61.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-2718004965b0207a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2117-c5687b942395652d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f30bb01764683cd9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2972-8ce94bd856f9372b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4194-e847e413fe1b63d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/tools/grammar-checker/page-bcc93c15c47c515b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-c819fc26cf8b0e32.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-8K10RNGN76\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\" as=\"script\" crossorigin=\"\"/><title>Korektor Grammar &amp; Essay Bahasa Inggris - Pengecekan AI Otomatis | TugasMu</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Cek tata bahasa, tenses, dan ejaan tulisan esai bahasa Inggris kamu. Dapatkan saran vocabulary yang lebih natural dan penjelasan kesalahan dalam bahasa Indonesia.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tugasmu.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TugasMu\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy bg-brand-lime\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Grammar checker</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container py-8 md:py-12 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Korektor Grammar &amp; Essay Bahasa Inggris</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-lg\">Jangan biarkan tugas essay atau PR bahasa Inggrismu penuh coretan merah. AI kami akan memperbaiki grammar, tenses, dan memberikan saran kosakata yang bikin tulisanmu terlihat lebih pro.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-md mb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Teks Bahasa Inggris</label><textarea rows=\"8\" placeholder=\"Paste essay atau tulisan bahasa Inggris kamu di sini...\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all resize-none disabled:opacity-50\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-sm disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">spellcheck</span><span>Koreksi Sekarang</span></button></form><div class=\"mt-16 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-heading prose-a:text-indigo-600\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-6 h-6 text-indigo-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg>Pentingnya Mengecek Grammar Sebelum Mengumpulkan Tugas</h2><p>Menulis dalam Bahasa Inggris (English writing) adalah salah satu tantangan terbesar bagi siswa SMP, SMA, maupun mahasiswa. Seringkali, kita menerjemahkan kalimat secara mentah-mentah dari Bahasa Indonesia ke Bahasa Inggris di kepala kita. Hasilnya? Susunan kata (<em>syntax</em>) menjadi aneh, dan <strong>tenses</strong> yang digunakan berantakan.</p><h3>Kesalahan Grammar yang Paling Sering Terjadi</h3><p>Berdasarkan analisis jutaan tugas siswa, berikut adalah kesalahan yang paling sering mengurangi nilai essay kamu:</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Subject-Verb Agreement:</strong> Ketidaksesuaian antara subjek dan kata kerja. Contoh salah: <em>&quot;She go to school.&quot;</em> (Seharusnya <em>&quot;She goes&quot;</em>).</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Tenses yang Tertukar:</strong> Menceritakan pengalaman liburan masa lalu (Recount Text) tetapi menggunakan Present Tense (V1) alih-alih Past Tense (V2).</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span><strong>Penggunaan Artikel (a, an, the):</strong> Menulis <em>&quot;an university&quot;</em> padahal seharusnya <em>&quot;a university&quot;</em> karena pelafalannya diawali huruf konsonan /j/.</span></li></ul><h3>Lebih dari Sekadar Mengecek Kesalahan</h3><p>Tool Grammar Checker TugasMu tidak hanya berfungsi seperti Grammarly yang menggarisbawahi teks yang salah. AI kami dirancang khusus sebagai <strong>Tutor Virtual</strong>. Setelah memperbaiki teksmu, AI akan memberikan penjelasan <em>mengapa</em> kalimatmu salah dalam Bahasa Indonesia yang mudah dipahami. Selain itu, kamu akan mendapat rekomendasi <strong>kosakata tingkat lanjut (Advanced Vocabulary)</strong> untuk meningkatkan level CEFR tulisanmu dari A2/B1 menjadi B2/C1.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Pertanyaan Seputar Pengecekan Grammar</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Panduan singkat tentang cara kerja korektor grammar ini.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah hasil perbaikan teks bisa mengubah makna cerita saya?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Tidak. AI kami dirancang hanya untuk memperbaiki struktur tata bahasa (grammar), tanda baca, dan pilihan kata tanpa mengubah inti cerita atau makna dari opini yang kamu tuliskan.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Berapa panjang teks maksimal yang bisa diperiksa?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Kamu bisa memasukkan hingga sekitar 3.000 kata sekaligus dalam satu kali pengecekan. Jika tugasmu berupa makalah panjang atau skripsi, kami sarankan untuk membaginya menjadi beberapa bagian (misal per paragraf atau per bab).</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah tool ini gratis digunakan?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Ya, fitur Grammar Checker gratis digunakan hingga batas harian tertentu untuk pengguna non-login. Untuk batas yang lebih besar, kamu bisa mendaftar akun gratis atau berlangganan paket Premium.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apa bedanya memilih jenjang SMP, SMA, atau Mahasiswa?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Pilihan jenjang mempengaruhi <strong>tingkat formalitas dan kompleksitas vocabulary</strong> yang akan disarankan oleh AI. Untuk jenjang SMP, AI akan menjaga kalimat tetap sederhana namun benar. Untuk level Mahasiswa, AI akan merekomendasikan gaya bahasa akademik (Academic English) yang cocok untuk jurnal atau paper.</p></div></div></details></div></section></div><div class=\"mt-12 mb-8\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Coba Tools Bermanfaat Lainnya</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-indigo-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group\" href=\"/tools/parafrase\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors\">Parafrase Makalah</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Ubah susunan kalimat teks yang terdeteksi plagiat menjadi tulisan yang segar dan orisinil.</p></a><a class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-sky-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group\" href=\"/tools/penerjemah-daerah\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big lucide-check-circle w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-sky-600 transition-colors\">Translator Kontekstual</h4></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600\">Terjemahkan bahasa daerah atau teks asing dengan hasil yang jauh lebih natural.</p></a></div></div></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex f